        "judge": {
          "description": "The model that decides the judge's dimensions of a turn's answer (ADR-0090). It must differ from the target's model. A hosted model receives the turns' messages and the target's answers. It needs a price, 0 for a local model, so --max-cost can be enforced.",
          "type": "object",
