          "description": "The model yokla analyze asks for values in the target's docs, prompts and code (ADR-0049). A hosted model receives those files' text. It needs a price, 0 for a local model, so --max-cost can be enforced.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "type": "string",
